1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:01,360
Why does a mosquito

2
00:00:01,400 --> 00:00:02,220
pick you

3
00:00:02,260 --> 00:00:03,690
and ignore your friend?

4
00:00:03,730 --> 00:00:04,920
It isn't luck.

5
00:00:04,960 --> 00:00:06,150
In one lab test,

6
00:00:06,190 --> 00:00:07,440
a single volunteer was

7
00:00:07,480 --> 00:00:08,650
about a hundred times

8
00:00:08,690 --> 00:00:09,550
more attractive

9
00:00:09,590 --> 00:00:11,670
than the least attractive person.

10
00:00:11,710 --> 00:00:12,575
Researchers linked it

11
00:00:12,615 --> 00:00:14,710
to fatty acids on the skin.

12
00:00:14,750 --> 00:00:15,880
Bacteria help turn them

13
00:00:15,920 --> 00:00:17,710
into your personal smell.

14
00:00:17,750 --> 00:00:19,725
Then a 2026 study tested

15
00:00:19,765 --> 00:00:21,125
three mosquito species

16
00:00:21,165 --> 00:00:23,280
on one hundred nineteen people.

17
00:00:23,320 --> 00:00:25,410
Nobody attracted all three.

18
00:00:25,450 --> 00:00:26,510
Each species wanted

19
00:00:26,550 --> 00:00:27,900
a different scent.

20
00:00:27,940 --> 00:00:29,155
So being a magnet

21
00:00:29,195 --> 00:00:30,535
depends on which mosquito

22
00:00:30,575 --> 00:00:31,950
is flying tonight.

